+## 2026-09-20 — OPEN — actuator diff-path parser fails open
+
+**Owner:** Tarik.
+
+**Mechanism:** `actuator/apply.py::touched_files()` recognizes only unquoted
+`diff --git a/<non-space> b/<non-space>` headers. Git quotes paths containing
+spaces and other special characters. An unparseable header therefore produces
+an empty touched-file set, bypassing the self-modification guard, traversal
+check, and per-file Python compilation.
+
+**Done-state:** replace the regex-only parser with a fail-closed parser for Git
+quoted paths and add passing tests for quoted protected paths, rename/delete
+headers, malformed headers, and any patch whose touched-file set is empty.
+
